<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Nov CPI rises 0.5 pct mo/mo, +8.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Nov CPI rises 0.5 pct mo/mo, +8.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech consumer prices rose 0.5 percent in November, putting prices 8.6 percent higher than in the same month of last year, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
</text>
